{
  "$comment": "Single source of keyboard shortcuts. `make shortcuts` generates Hikki/Sources/Generated/Shortcuts.swift (the `Shortcut` enum: KeyboardShortcut + display string) and editor/src/generated/shortcuts.ts (SHORTCUTS: match keydown events, display strings). `bound`: `app` — the native menu binds the key (the page must not handle it); `editor` — the page handles it, native menus only display it; `both` — the page handles it when it has focus and the native menu covers the rest (find). Modifiers: command, shift, option, control. Keys: a character, or arrowUp/arrowDown/arrowLeft/arrowRight/tab/return/escape/delete.",
